course: dictionary
lesson: 14305
title: Nutrition and healthy food
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Nutrition is the food your body needs to grow, stay healthy and have energy. Context gives you clues. «Good nutrition helps a body grow strong.» Strong and grow tell you that nutrition is something that does good things for your body.
explain: Nutrition can also mean the study of food and how it affects the body. «Our science class is learning about nutrition this week.» Here nutrition is a subject you study, not a meal or a snack.
explain: The words good and poor show you whether nutrition is helping or harming. «Poor nutrition can leave a body feeling tired and weak.» Poor means not enough of what the body needs, so the body becomes tired.
fact: Nutrition is a noun, and it is uncountable, so we do not say «a nutrition» or «nutritions».
fact: «Good nutrition» means eating a balanced diet with fruit, vegetables, carbohydrates, protein, dairy and a little fat.
fact: Nutrients, such as vitamins and minerals, are the parts of food that your body needs to stay healthy.
fact: Food labels show «nutrition information», such as energy, fat, sugar and salt.
fact: «Poor nutrition» means the body is not getting the food it needs to grow and stay healthy.
exercise: «Maya eats apples, carrots, milk and fish, so she has good nutrition.» What does good nutrition mean? | *Food that helps your body grow and stay healthy | Only sweets and crisps | Food that is very expensive | Food you eat in the dark
exercise: «The label shows the nutrition information.» What might the label show? | The name of the shop | *Energy, fat, sugar and salt | The price of the food | Pictures of the farm where the food grew
exercise: «Ella's class is learning about nutrition in science.» What does nutrition mean here? | The name of a teacher | A kind of fruit | A football game | *The study of food and how it affects the body
test: «Poor nutrition can leave a body feeling tired and weak.» What does poor nutrition mean? | Food that is cooked in a pan | Food eaten only at parties | *Food that does not give the body what it needs | Food that is very cheap
test: Which of these is part of a balanced diet for good nutrition? | Sweets | Fizzy drinks | Crisps | *Vegetables
exam: Jamal says nutrition is just another word for sweets. Why is he wrong? | Sweets are the best nutrition in the world | Nutrition is only about football | Nutrition means a shop that sells sweets | *Nutrition is the food your body needs to grow and stay healthy, and sweets are not enough on their own
